  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41302" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Labour Organization (ILO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO will support a regional seminar to strengthen trade union strategies for addressing informality and promoting the transition to formality in the Arab region. The activity will provide a platform for trade unions to exchange experiences, identify common challenges, and develop practical approaches to improve outreach, representation, and services for workers in the informal economy. It will contribute to enhanced regional coordination and strengthened capacity of workers&#x2019; organizations to advance inclusive, rights-based strategies aligned with international labour standards, particularly Recommendation No. 204. The programme will primarily benefit trade unions and workers in the informal economy and will be implemented in collaboration with regional workers&#x2019; organizations and relevant stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
